ives à une „obligation morale\" aux „formes de civilisation\" et aux „différents systèmes juridiques\"; tout cela est trop vague et prête à une foule…","en":"…ifferent legal systems\", in a draft of this kind; such expressions were too vague and lent themselves to a host of criticisms. As, however, his colleagues seemed to like expressions of this kind, he declared that he was prepared to vote in favour of the Article as now amended, since it contained a number of guarantees for the composition of the Court.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0449.07","speaker_id":"ricci-busatti","certain":true,"name":"Arturo Ricci-Busatti","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-11","weight":1.0,"end":277,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":3396,"start":221}]},{"seg_id":"s0449.08","meeting":19,"doc":"minutes","pdf":449,"printed":439,"texts":{"fr":"M. HAGERUP demande que le texte amendé de l'article 11 soit lu avant d'être mis au vote; ce texte est ainsi conçu: „Dans toute élection de juges ou de juges suppléants, les électeurs devront s'assurer que les juges élus soient en possession des conditions requises; ils auront l'obligation morale de…","en":"M. HAGERUP asked that the amended draft of Article 11 should be read before being put to the vote. The draft was as follows: \"In all elections of judges and supplementary judges the electors shall satisfy themselves that the judges elected are in possession of the necessary qualifications; they shall be under the moral obligation to seek to have represented in the Court the main forms of civilisation and the principal legal …","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0449.08","speaker_id":"hagerup","certain":true,"name":"Francis Hagerup","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-11","weight":1.0,"end":68,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":3401,"start":22}]}]},{"meeting":32,"section":"32","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0685.02","meeting":32,"doc":"annex","pdf":685,"printed":675,"texts":{"fr":"Si, après la première séance d'élection, il reste encore des sièges à pourvoir, il est procédé de la même manière à une seconde, puis à une troisième.","en":"If, after the first sitting held for the purpose of the election, one or more seats remain to be filled, a second and if necessary, a third sitting shall take place.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-11","weight":1.0,"end":103,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":5256,"start":0}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":2},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":0},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"count":0},{"meeting":28,"count":0},{"meeting":29,"count":0},{"meeting":30,"count":0},{"meeting":31,"count":0},{"meeting":32,"count":1},{"meeting":33,"count":0},{"meeting":34,"count":0},{"meeting":35,"count":0}],"members":[{"id":"ricci-busatti","name":"Arturo Ricci-Busatti","count":1},{"id":"hagerup","name":"Francis Hagerup","count":1}],"passage_count":3,"sources":["Edition"],"includes_descendants":false}